   "en": "{07 04 00}Hey, hang on, {01 00 00 05 00}that letter\nlooks like it's been{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}\n{07 02 00}EEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEK!\n{07 08 00}Why is it all torn?!{01 00 00 0a 00}\nOh, I can't believe this,\n{01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!\nNow I have to rewrite the\nwhole thing! {01 00 00 05 00}Gimme back\nthat one!{03 02 00 01}",
