  },
  {
   "id": 1,
   "en": "{07 00 00}I gotta ask, {04 1f 00}...{01 00 00 05 00}\n{07 0e 00}That letter is{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}the one I\ngave you, right?\n{07 01 00}Then{01 00 00 03 00}{01 08 00} WHY IS IT OPEN?!{01 01 00}\n{07 15 00}That's a breach of privacy!{01 00 00 0a 00}\nGimme that, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!{03 02 00 01}",
   "et": "{07 00 00}Pean küsima, {04 1f 00}...{01 00 00 05 00}\n{07 0e 00}See kiri on{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}see, mille\nma sulle andsin, eks?\n{07 01 00}Siis{01 00 00 03 00}{01 08 00} MIKS SEE ON LAHTI?!{01 01 00}\n{07 15 00}See on eraelu rikkumine!{01 00 00 0a 00}\nAnna see siia, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!{03 02 00 01}"
